### VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above each ###
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all items
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### 2. Add item (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Black phone","category":"Electronics","location_found":"Library, 2nd floor","date_found":"2026-11-05","claimed":false}

### 3. Get one item
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1

### 4. Update item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Black phone","category":"Electronics","location_found":"Library, 2nd floor","date_found":"2026-11-05","claimed":true}

### 5. Delete item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/1

### ERR 6. Item does not exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/99999

### ERR 7. Missing name (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"category":"Keys","location_found":"Gate","date_found":"2026-11-05"}

### ERR 8. Bad date (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Keys","category":"Keys","location_found":"Gate","date_found":"yesterday"}

### ERR 9. Update item that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Keys","category":"Keys","location_found":"Gate","date_found":"2026-11-05","claimed":false}

### ERR 10. Delete item that does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/99999

### ERR 11. Invalid id (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/abc
